{"version":1,"content":"<p>超強颶風「瑪莉」今年9月吹襲美國加州，奧斯卡金像影帝尼古拉斯基治（Nicolas Cage）位於加州馬利布的1,050萬美元（約8,200萬港元）4,000尺海邊豪宅被波及，大屋對出位置地面下陷驚現30 X 30尺巨型坑洞。</p><p>尼古拉斯周六（3</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:04:53.704350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T00:34:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.242584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.242584+00:00","content_hash":"a81a233178bdf337b8bf566b50f32d4fe2a3f0d5827aa68585c876c30a17e8bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}